1
00:00:00,227 --> 00:00:02,227
(Penny:)...and want to marry
Howard wolowitz?

2
00:00:02,813 --> 00:00:07,523
- I do, with all my heart.
- Tsk, got it. Just had to check.

3
00:00:10,821 --> 00:00:12,241
(Amy:)He's great.

4
00:00:16,827 --> 00:00:18,787
(Leonard:)All right, Sheldon.
We're going to Wil's.

5
00:00:18,955 --> 00:00:23,505
(Leonard:)- This is your last chance.
- No, Leonard, this is your last chance.

6
00:00:23,668 --> 00:00:27,338
(Sheldon:)One day, a historian
is going to come to you and say:

7
00:00:27,505 --> 00:00:30,635
"ls it true you were friends
with Dr. Sheldon Cooper?"

8
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:34,720
(Sheldon:)And you're going to have to choke back
a hot sob of regret and humiliation...

9
00:00:34,887 --> 00:00:38,177
(Sheldon:)...as you mumble,
"l was, but I chose to go to a party...

10
00:00:38,349 --> 00:00:42,479
(Sheldon:)...thrown by the one kid from
Stand By Me that no one remembers."

11
00:00:45,982 --> 00:00:47,982
- You want to drive?
- Sure.

12
00:00:52,738 --> 00:00:56,278
- Hey, Sheldon?
- Oh, good. You picked me, you picked me.

13
00:00:56,450 --> 00:01:00,700
(Leonard:)No, I just got a text from Stuart.
Brent Spiner is at the party.

